    "id": "superexam-internal-medicine-0134",
    "subject": "internal-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 134,
    "stem": "A 32-year old female, presents to the clinic with\nsymptoms of fatigue, joint pains, and facial rash. On\nexamination she was noted to be thin with malar\nskin changes. CBC with platelet count was requested\nwhich will most likely reveal:",
