    "id": "superexam-internal-medicine-0317",
    "subject": "internal-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 317,
    "stem": "A 47 y/o male asymptomatic presents in your clinic\nwith an incidental finding of WBC count 110x109 /L,\nbasophilia, eosinophilia and obliterated traube\nspace. Cytogenetic studies showed t(9,22). Which of\nthe following is true about his condition except?",
