    "originalNumber": 547,
    "stem": "A 35/F, diagnosed case of SLE, comes in for a follow\nup. Routine labs done revealed the following results:\nABG: pH 7.35, pCO2 34, pO2 of 98; Na 132; K 3.2; Cl\n108; and HCO3 12. The patient's metabolic disorder\nis likely due to:",
