    "originalNumber": 616,
    "stem": "This syndrome results from defective hypothalamic\ngonadotropin-releasing hormone (GnRH) synthesis\nand is associated with anosmia or hyposmia due to\nolfactory bulb agenesis or hypoplasia:",
