    "id": "superexam-internal-medicine-0619",
    "subject": "internal-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 619,
    "stem": "A 63-year old congestive heart failure patient\nfrequently complains of worsening orthopnea,\nrequiring him to use 4 pillows when sleeping. The\nmost probable mechanism for this is:",
